<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" class="bordercolor">
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=174" title="View the profile of Delheru">Delheru</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Hill Giant<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 104<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/blank.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=174"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=813.msg7710#msg7710"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=813.msg7710#msg7710">Re:History of Rodcet Nife  [read and add to it]</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #30 on:</b> May 05, 2004, 12:52:01 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Thanks for the input guys.<br /><br />Some things do make me curious still though:<br /><br />Why did LoRN, CoP and Thelyn Amar all fold? I have a fairly good idea about TA, but none about CoP and LoRN. Requires some mad oldschool infos admittedly.<br /><br />Where the hell did Reign of Swords come from, and what have they done?<br /><br />Arirang dates in generel. When did Nash and Achiel leave?<br />Does anyone remember individual acts by Carol? I remember that ninjalooting of a tear from Dozekar that split the EK/Arirang alliance. But some of that juicier stuff like the irl death threats etc :P
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg7711"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=62" title="View the profile of Glayde">Glayde</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Guild Officer<br />
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 17<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/blank.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=62"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:tle@umich.edu"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=813.msg7711#msg7711"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=813.msg7711#msg7711">Re:History of Rodcet Nife  [read and add to it]</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #31 on:</b> May 05, 2004, 12:58:13 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<br />Bos -&gt;Bos+Diadem -&gt;Bos+Sor-&gt;AD+DK-&gt;DF<br /><br />May 1999.<br /><br />Krowbar, Dwilgar and Glayde begin playing on Rodcet Nife.<br />Krowbar picked the server because it had a low number of players, since it<br />was the newest server.<br /><br />Oct 1999.<br /><br />The Brotherhood of Steel was formed, with Glayde as guildleader. We made<br />the guild for Batmud players and friends we made here.<br /><br />Some Batmud players that were around the early days:<br /><br />Glayde, Dwilgar, Krowbar, Ilian(daria), Bryek(braik), Aruthra, Eredas(crackfiend), Gylen(galronio), Jerrod(zarman), Reia(doughnut), Delheru(asmodean), Fister(correl), Xpoc(entropy), Lykra(lark), Betto(beanie), Darragh(oak), Sliight, Fulgore, Birdie, Korasia, Pimest(pim), Jodi (ewige), Klar, Moonwraith(moonshine).<br /><br />Other batmudders who made appearances but never stuck around, Brillo, Tank, Tama, Zyn, Haderak, Morgin, Chandris, Anessa, Digga, Xylid, &nbsp;and others.<br /><br />Shoog and Melidia were our first non-Bat members and founders. Zretch and Orbitalx joined us a bit down the road as some of our other earlier non-Batmud members.<br /><br />For a short time we had some of Klar and Moon&#039;s friends with us, Markin, Xanatax, Armanthius, Honch, Derelica and a few others, but they eventually left to form a higher level guild for raiding.<br /><br />We met another small guild that we eventually merged with, the Diadem, led by Jabber. Azeron, Puffbo, Onodrim and Thran were notable members.<br /><br />Aruthra started playing a bit behind us and made some friends, some of who were in the Guardians of the Malt, and they ended up joining us: Meeks, Gegtik, and a few others. Eretria and Sbena joined us around this time as well.<br /><br />March 2000<br /><br />In the spring of 2000 we merged with Souls of Relevance, led by Tuvas and Corona. Beleni, Dwynn, Lastel, Shayl, Maglan, Xiaohai, Montaz, Thunderwulf, Daene, Wixramiablo, Aaric, Mufin, Kiladen and others made up SoR. <br /><br />We did some heavy Guk farming as our first real raids.<br /><br />We reformed into the guild known as Altered Destiny, Corona took over guild leadership. The first Moostock was run around this time. Demott, Vesi(continuity) and Lumilla(odina) joined us as well.<br /><br />Kunark came and we eventually killed Trakanon first on the server, with our allies, Dragon Knight, led by Envino and Mcrush. Jazzy, Reyem, Krystia, Spewidette, Luupos(mcbashin) and Fizwin were some of the leadership. <br /><br />When Velious came out we merged guilds to Dragon Force. Eventually getting to ToV and killing first broods and entering Sleeper&#039;s Tomb for primals. &nbsp;We also did Statue and Dain. This time period spread into the Luclin Era. Corona and Mcrush had retired leaving the guild to be run mainly by a council consisting of Envino, Krystia, Bryek, Eretria, Gylen and Glayde. Wolfia and Maui joined the guild around this time as well.<br /><br />During Luclin we continued the primal farm from Sleepers along with some early Luclin content, (THO). We were running alongside DA/EIE which had just formed and WoW for most of this time, with Ascent and AoD doing harder content beyond us.<br /><br />We ended up disbanding in May of 2002 due to losing too many people to retirement and feeding the higher guilds (mostly Ascent).<br /><br />I, myself, moved on and applied to Ascent later that summer, just after Ascent killed Emperor in Ssra and began raiding VT.<br /><br /><br />Later in Planes of Power, some of the older members came back led by Rhonwyn(Eretria) to form Phoenix Evolution which was a small guild that just recently broke up with some members moving to Apothesis to continue raiding in PoP towards Time.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg7712"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=485" title="View the profile of Daemii">Daemii</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 29<br />
								<br />
								<br />
								/poke<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=485"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=813.msg7712#msg7712"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=813.msg7712#msg7712">Re:History of Rodcet Nife  [read and add to it]</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #32 on:</b> May 05, 2004, 01:21:36 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							not for sure but wasnt Reign of Swords created from &nbsp;ex members from Axiom Shift after it disbanded? please correct me if i&#039;m wrong.<br /><br /><br />daemii eloquist<br />65 marauder <br />dragons fist <br />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />daemii eloquist<br />67 marauder<br />&lt;ruination&gt;
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg7713"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=593" title="View the profile of Cataclysm">Cataclysm</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 8<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/blank.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								An Everquest Player on Rodcet Nife<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=593"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:xcatax@bellsouth.net"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=813.msg7713#msg7713"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=813.msg7713#msg7713">Re:History of Rodcet Nife  [read and add to it]</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #33 on:</b> May 05, 2004, 01:22:43 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							I believe CoP might&#039;ve died due to internal leadership/officer problems, mainly between Mirax and Axine from what I remember, which is really fuzzy especially considering I wasn&#039;t even in the guild. LoRN, absolutely no clue. Dyvim/Axine/Satao and a few others seemed to be a perma group that stuck around forever through those times though, so maybe finding one of them can clear things up a lot. The leaderships of those two guilds were fairly similar, LoRN just seemed to be AoD/AL before they turned into two different guilds.<br /><br />The main thing I remember about RoS is their semi monopoly of BoT tower nameds at one time, and a joint raid of Apotheosis/Theft of Life/Reign of Swords on Aerin`Dar and Terris Thule several months before RoS split into Conviction. <br /><br />I&#039;m thinking there&#039;s at least one guild that should receive some mention, I&#039;m not sure exactly where Apotheosis is right now as far as being one of the top guilds on server, definately not on the very top, but moving up there I think.<br /><br />Vengeance, created by a disgruntled ex-AoD member (Boblar, had a gnome necro...) somewhere in late 1999-early 2000, had a lot of old school people who were/became/are pretty popular and/or high end, Leanan could probably give a whole lot more infos, but V was pretty active for its&#039; time even if not in the completely high end game.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
