							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Cascade Point split on April 29, 2002 wherein the &quot;core&quot; members took seperate paths, applying to EiE (Barun, Aurra, Timoteo, Oosiris et al) with the rest forming Reign of Swords under Galem&#039;s leadership. <br /><br />I don&#039;t recall the exact date RoS formed so maybe an &quot;original&quot; member can post it. Probably around the first week of May 2002 I think.<br /><br />cheers &nbsp;<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/smiley1.gif" alt="Smiley" border="0" /><br /><br />
						</td>
