							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Mawwy. ^^<br /><br />I believe the first revamped Innoruuk was killed by Pirates of Velious, which was basically AoD/AL/EL combined effort. The guild was created, at least for AoD, in order to re-organize our guild (I think it was the same for EL), since a lot of members had become inactive and we didn&#039;t know who the fux some of the people were, and since there was no alt+g tool we couldn&#039;t determine or find out anything, and there seemed to be information leaking from within the guild.<br /><br />Immediately during/after it&#039;s creation we tried to raid a bunch of stuff, was really interesting and annoying with 100+++ people in the same guildchat.
						</td>
